            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkenlerde olduğu gibi, sınıfları da açıklayıcı şekilde adlandırmaya çalışırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" author: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", title: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"B\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>class</code>, ardından <code>Book</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
