            "id": 127530,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkenleri ve fonksiyonları adlandırırken olduğu gibi, öğeleri tutarlı bir şekilde adlandırmalı ve büyük-küçük harf kullanımına dikkat etmeliyiz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayHello\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayBye\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bye&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" teacher = \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher.sayBye()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"267\" endIndex=\"273\" /><option startIndex=\"273\" endIndex=\"274\" /><option startIndex=\"274\" endIndex=\"275\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Saybye\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bye\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>sayBye</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
