            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıfların dışındaki metotlar gibi, Swift'in yerleşik fonksiyonlarını ve temel özelliklerini kullanabilirsin.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flavor: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients: [\" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(flavor: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", ingredients: [\" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"]) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".flavor = flavor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".ingredients = ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"printIngredients\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredient \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients {    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(ingredient)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" />